sequenceDiagram
  title Signing in with a Canvas account and two-step verification
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API
  participant D as Database
  U->>W: Email and password
  W->>A: POST /auth/local/login
  A->>D: Read account, failed attempts
  alt wrong password
    A->>D: Count the failure (third one locks the account)
    A-->>W: 401
  else right password
    A->>D: New session, waiting for the second step
    A-->>W: 200, mfaRequired
    U->>W: Code from the authenticator app
    W->>A: POST /auth/mfa/verify
    A->>D: Check the TOTP step was not used before
    A->>D: Rotate the session id, mark it verified
    A-->>W: 200, session cookie
  end
  Note over W,A: With Entra sign-in instead, /auth/login and /auth/callback run OpenID Connect with PKCE
